          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too Lharisit, naa Kenaia o layiok lenyena, negeluni tenkaraki isiaaitin e boo too Siraeli, metaa ilkituaak o larishak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Hebron, naa Hashabia o lalashera lenyena, iltung'ana enkalifu nabo o iip naapishana oata enkidimata, ooing'or aagolie Isirael, te nkalo o loo ntoluo olkeju le Yordan, te siaai pookiOlaitoriani, o te nkisiayiare olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Hebron, naa Yeriya olkitok loo le Hebron te pooki iishoritin o too nkajijik oo loo menye. (Ore to lari liartam le nkitoria e Daudi, netujurroki iltung'ana netumi iltung'ana oata enkidimata tiatua ninche te Yaser tiatua Gilead.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etegelua olaiguanani Daudi ninye o lalashera lenyena, iltung'ana nkalifuni are o iip naapishana oata enkidimata, nena lukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye, pee eitasheiki ile Ruben, o le Gad, olpisiai lo losho le Manase te pooki bae naipirta Enkai o too mbaa o laiguanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
